-- R5 Pro / EC75 Pro from rc-ev.com, and CNG models in «Хөргүүртэй болон тусгай зориулалтын» (user, 2026-11-21).
--
-- A. The four Pro sheets came from the Google Sheet and lacked rows rc-ev.com has (app, smart 12V, HMA, ...), which on the
--    merged R5 / EC75 page (src/data/pro.ts) read as "R5 Pro has no app". Rebuilt from rc-ev.com R5PROHYB / R5PROKYB /
--    EC75PROHYB / EC75PROKYB with scripts/specs/import-rcev.mts like 0014 did for R5 / EC75: only the 61.94 kWh trims,
--    passenger = the non-commercial versions with 6 / 9 seats merged. Trim names now match R5 / EC75
--    (Supercharge Pioneer I, Smart Supercharge Pioneer I, Smart Supercharge Transcendence I); EC75 Pro gets its top trim.
--    Kept from the old sheets: payload (1500–2000 kg) and the CLTC standard, which rc-ev.com does not list.
-- B. CNG range-extender C5s move from the flatbed / box menus to «Хөргүүртэй болон тусгай зориулалтын», after C3 cold
--    and R5 service.
--
-- Safe with the code before and after feat/model-page-b (no name prefixes, same sheet format). Safe to run twice.

